s://api.github.com/users/coffeebeats/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coffeebeats/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coffeebeats/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coffeebeats/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coffeebeats/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coffeebeats/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coffeebeats/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coffeebeats/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coffeebeats/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111404#pullrequestreview-3511172720","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111404","author_association":"NONE","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111404#pullrequestreview-3511172720"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111404"}},"submitted_at":"2025-11-26T14:14:59Z","commit_id":"e353177985174121884f0073fc1ffe7e43edbb2c"},{"id":3511966075,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7RVFl7","user":{"login":"Mickeon","id":66727710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NzI3NzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66727710?u=8069d9b7bc6ab503ce83dfcfa53fd021672aeccf&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon","html_url":"https://github.com/Mickeon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I must **heavily** note that I am not part of the Input team, nor I have much agency to get this PR in a stable state and potentially accepted. So take the following with a grain of salt.\r\n\r\nFrom what I understand, this PR does not touch the Input Map panel much. It's a missed opportunity though, as it means that different input events assigned to different players are hard to discern.\r\n\r\nThe current system works well, but seemingly falls apart when multiple players are using the same device. It somewhat defeats its purpose, as code would still be required to work around it, but it's also potentially inevitable and that I can understand.\r\n\r\nI'm personally debating whether it's better to have the flexibility of a bitmask, at the cost of essentially limiting the \"players\" to `32`/`64` (which is a ridiculous amount anyway) and verbosity (having to rely on constants instead of simpler numbers).\r\nI am inclined to favour a bitmask approach, mostly because it's more distinct. To explain, the current \"individual player\" approach is almost no different than creating multiple similar actions for each player (either [programmatically](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_inputmap.html#class-inputmap-method-add-action) or manually), then querying the action with some code (for example `is_action(\"jump_\" + str(player_number))`. That is to say, it already _can_ be done, and this PR as is currently only serves as a quality-of-life addition.\r\nWhile a bitmask would make the system more customizable, it's also quite... useless? I can hardly think of any reason to query more than one player at once. It's either \"all players\" or \"one player\". At least for the purposes of this PR, because the bitmask is actually necessary in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102412 .","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111404#pullrequestreview-3511966075","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111404","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111404#pullrequestreview-3511966075"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111404"}},"submitted_at":"2025-11-26T18:55:02Z","commit_id":"e353177985174121884f0073fc1ffe7e43edbb2c"},{"id":3520801239,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7R2ynX","user":{"login":"coffeebeats","id":108542400,"node_id":"U_kgDOBng5wA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108542400?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/coffeebeats","html_url":"https://github.com/coffeebeats","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coffeebeats/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coffeebeats/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coffeebeats/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coffeebeats/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coffeebeats/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coffeebeats/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coffeebeats/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coffeebeats/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coffeebeats/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111404#pullrequestreview-3520801239","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111404","author_association":"NONE","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111404#pullrequestreview-3520801239"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godot